body: "## Outcome\nThe pm SDK is a complete, documented, public API for repository-native project context. The CLI is one presentation layer over it; MCP is another; third parties can build a third.\n\n## Why this is a milestone, not an epic\npm-usfg is the living promotion epic. This milestone is the outcome gate that the universal-domain milestone and the GA semver surface both consume.\n\n## Delivery chain\nRemaining pm-usfg promotion slices -> boundary ratchet hardened to a failing gate -> authoring docs and exemplar -> pm-feecbs conformance gate can then measure external packages against a stable surface.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNot an API freeze — semver commitments belong to the GA milestone. Not a rewrite: promotion moves code, it does not redesign it."
